    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KW Castles are pleased to present No 17 Merchants Square, East Wall, Dublin 3\r\n\r\nOne-Bedroom House in Exclusive Enclave.\r\n\r\nTucked away in the sought-after Merchants Square development, this charming one-bedroom house offers a rare combination of privacy, space, and value in one of Dublin 3’s most convenient locations.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n               One bedroom house set within a small, exclusive enclave\r\n               Extra-wide rear garden — a standout feature rarely found at this price point, offering excellent potential for outdoor living or extension\r\n               Room to extend, subject to planning permission\r\n               Designated/street parking\r\n               Very low service charge, making this an economical choice for owner-occupiers or investors\r\n               Bright, well-proportioned living accommodation\r\n               Quiet, tucked-away position within the wider East Wall community\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nEast Wall is a well-established and increasingly popular Dublin 3 neighbourhood, offering excellent connectivity to the city centre, the Point Village, Docklands, and the M1/Dublin Port Tunnel. Local amenities, schools, and public transport links are all within easy reach, making this an ideal spot for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking strong rental demand."
